Third-party files modified by Codyxander
-----------------------------------------------
The following files were generated by the Tauri CLI
(Tauri Programme within The Commons Conservancy, MIT OR Apache-2.0)
and then modified by Codyxander. Each one says so in its header,
or in REUSE.toml when it cannot carry a comment.

- src-tauri/: main.rs, lib.rs, Cargo.toml, tauri.conf.json, .gitignore
- src-tauri/gen/android/: the Android project (manifest, Gradle build,
  resources, launcher icons)
- src-tauri/plugins/tauri-plugin-keep-screen-on/: scaffolded with
  `tauri plugin new`

The Gradle wrapper (src-tauri/gen/android/gradlew, gradlew.bat and
gradle/) is included unmodified, under the Apache License 2.0
(Copyright 2015 the original authors).

Some files mix original FF5 content and new code by Codyxander
(index.html; src/scss/global.scss and char.scss, converted from the original
CSS; src/scss/roomLayout.scss, built from the original inline styles). Their
header says so: the original parts remain unlicensed, the changes and
additions are under the Apache License 2.0.

The original game is in English only. src/locales/en-US.json holds its texts
plus new interface texts; the other languages are translations by Alexandre
Vuillet. As they derive from the original texts, those remain FF5's
(see REUSE.toml).

The licence and authors of every file are listed in its SPDX header or in
REUSE.toml (https://reuse.software).
